   /* K3 practice dashboard (Chunk 2) — density tuned for #5502 above-the-fold CTA */
   :global(.k3-practice-dashboard) {
     display: grid;
     gap: 0.4rem;
     max-width: 800px;
     margin: 0 auto;
   }

   /* #5772 — desktop fold. Measured at 1366x768 on the single-column layout: the
      primary CTAs landed at 932px, 164px below the fold, because the hero (147px),
      stats (62px) and the 293px deck preview all stack above them while ~560px of
      horizontal space sits unused. The earlier #5502 density pass tuned spacing
      but could not absorb that on its own.

      Pair the deck preview with the session panel rather than shaving padding
      again: it uses the width that is already there, and it keeps the primary CTA
      beside the deck it acts on. DOM order is untouched, so the documented
      hero → stats → words → session → secondary order still holds and the
      reading order matches the visual order.

      Design delta 2026-07-26 (D1): the baseline's "focus modes" last row is gone —
      the standalone focus-word zone is deleted, so `.k3-secondary` (now just the
      weak-area chips, if any, plus the mode grid) fills the full-width "modes"
      row alone. The "." filler row is deliberate — it keeps `.k3-words` reaching
      the full column height without cramming a fifth left-column row into it. */
   @media (min-width: 1000px) {
     :global(.k3-practice-dashboard) {
       max-width: 1040px;
       grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 340px);
       grid-template-rows: auto auto auto 1fr auto;
       grid-template-areas:
         "hero words"
         "stats words"
         "session words"
         ". words"
         "modes modes";
       align-items: start;
     }
     :global(.k3-hero) {
       grid-area: hero;
     }
     :global(.k3-stats) {
       grid-area: stats;
     }
     :global(.k3-words) {
       grid-area: words;
     }
     :global(.k3-session) {
       grid-area: session;
     }
     :global(.k3-secondary) {
       grid-area: modes;
     }
   }

   :global(.k3-hero h1) {
     margin: 0;
     font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.05rem);
     line-height: 1;
   }
   :global(.k3-hero-subtitle) {
     margin: 0.3rem 0 0;
     color: var(--lu-text-muted);
     font-size: 1.02rem;
     font-weight: 800;
